   "y": 666,
   "width": 1500,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**sliding-window attention** — 16 q heads share 8 KV heads (2:1 GQA), head 256, scale 1 (qk-norm does the scaling)  \ncausal, last 1024 tokens · image tokens also see their own image",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
